@startuml reading-a-receipt
!include ../diagram-style.puml
' docs/architecture.md §6.3: reading a receipt.
hide footbox
autonumber
actor "User" as U
participant "Web app" as W
participant "ReceiptParseController" as C
participant "Parse strategy" as S
participant "@steuereule/core" as K
participant "SingleShotModel" as M

U -> W : uploads a PDF or a photo
note over W : the text is produced in the browser:\nPDF text layer or on-device OCR (ADR-0060)
W -> C : POST /v1/belege/parse (text, no image data)
C -> S : strategy by document kind
S -> K : fixed rules read what they recognise with certainty
S -> K : scrubDocumentTextPii
S -> M : one call with the scrubbed text
M --> S : JSON
note over S : schema check; on error, timeout\nor refusal the result of the rules stands
S --> W : draft with fields and provenance
U -> W : confirms field by field
@enduml
